btw EXIT: 1
btw ERR: kaboom
btw AMBIG-26: "reported" is taken to mean the report includes the error message.
btw The other tasks still run first, the report and exit happen when the program ends.
cook boom() { yeet "kaboom" }
cook ok() { yap "ok ran" }
lowkey t = sendit boom()
sendit ok()
yap "main done"                          btw OUT: main done
btw OUT: ok ran
